TC-S2-TST-05-A: Authentication, Login & Session Management Regression
Test Component: Authentication & Login Flows
Test Description: Re-verify valid user login, invalid credential rejection, account lockout / blocked user enforcement (is_blocked = true), 
session persistence (public.user_session), and logout invalidation after Sprint 2 codebase updates.

Test Steps:
-Log in with valid active credentials (status = 'Active', is_blocked = false) and verify redirect to the main dashboard.
-Attempt login with an incorrect password, a Pending account, and a blocked account (is_blocked = true), confirming appropriate rejection errors.
-Trigger logout and verify the active session token is invalidated and protected routes redirect back to login

Expected Result: Valid logins succeed, blocked/pending/invalid attempts are rejected, and logout terminates active sessions cleanly without regressions.
Actual Result: Authentication, blocked-user checks, and session lifecycle executed cleanly with zero regressions.
Status: PASS ✅

TC-S2-TST-05-B: Forgot Password & Password Reset Token Flow Regression
Test Component: Password Recovery Flow
Test Description: Verify that password reset requests generate valid single-use tokens in public.password_reset_token, 
update password_hash securely, and reject expired or already-used tokens.

Test Steps:
-Submit a password reset request for an active account and verify token creation (expires_at, is_used = false).
-Complete the password reset using the valid token and log in with the newly set password.
-Attempt to reuse the consumed reset token (is_used = true) and confirm rejection.

Expected Result: Password reset completes successfully on valid unused tokens and rejects expired or reused tokens
Actual Result: Password reset token generation, password update, and single-use enforcement verified with no regressions.

Status: PASS ✅

